    "title": "Lynchburg Water Resources to celebrate World Water Day with facility tours - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago On March 21, Lynchburg Water Resources (LWR) will celebrate World Water Day by hosting free tours for the public of the College Hill Water Treatment Plant and the Lynchburg Regional Water Resource Recovery Facility (WRRF). Citizens can attend one or both of the tours, which will start at the College Hill plant at 11:00 a.m. followed by the WRRF tour at 12:00 p.m. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
